## 🖥️ Stap 2 — Maak de Frontend op met Vite

### 2a. Initialiseer het Vite-project

```powershell
cd TypeScript
pnpm create vite@latest Frontend -- --template vanilla-ts
cd Frontend
pnpm install
```

Dit genereert automatisch:
- `index.html`
- `src/main.ts`
- `tsconfig.json`
- `package.json`
- `vite.config.ts` *(optioneel, niet in dit project)*

### 2b. Pas `package.json` aan

```json
{
  "name": "javascript_2026_08_frontend",
  "private": true,
  "version": "0.0.0",
  "type": "module",
  "scripts": {
    "dev": "vite",
    "build": "tsc && vite build",
    "preview": "vite preview",
    "lint": "biome check --write",
    "lint-fix": "biome check --write --unsafe",
    "format": "biome format --write"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@biomejs/biome": "2.5.0",
    "typescript": "~5.8.3",
    "vite": "^8.0.16"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@popperjs/core": "^2.11.8",
    "bootstrap": "^5.3.8"
  }
}
```

### 2c. Pas `tsconfig.json` aan (Bundler mode)

```json
{
  "compilerOptions": {
    "target": "ES2020",
    "useDefineForClassFields": true,
    "module": "ESNext",
    "lib": ["ES2020", "DOM", "DOM.Iterable"],
    "skipLibCheck": true,

    /* Bundler mode — Vite doet de bundling, niet tsc */
    "moduleResolution": "bundler",
    "allowImportingTsExtensions": true,
    "verbatimModuleSyntax": false,
    "moduleDetection": "force",
    "noEmit": true,

    /* Strikte linting */
    "strict": true,
    "noUnusedLocals": true,
    "noUnusedParameters": true,
    "erasableSyntaxOnly": true,
    "noFallthroughCasesInSwitch": true,
    "noUncheckedSideEffectImports": true
  },
  "include": ["src"]
}
```

> [!NOTE]
> `"noEmit": true` betekent dat TypeScript **geen JS-bestanden uitvoert** — dat doet Vite.
> TypeScript wordt hier enkel gebruikt voor type-checking.

### 2d. Voeg Biome toe (linter + formatter)

```powershell
pnpm add -D @biomejs/biome
pnpm biome init
```

Pas daarna `biome.json` aan naar de gewenste instellingen (single quotes, geen semicolons, etc.).

### 2e. Maak de `src/`-mappenstructuur aan

```powershell
mkdir src\models
mkdir src\components
mkdir src\pages
mkdir src\router
mkdir src\data
```

### 2f. Maak `pnpm-workspace.yaml`

Dit bestand staat in `Frontend/` en whitelists de `esbuild`-build tool:

```yaml
allowBuilds:
  esbuild: true
```

